    "Posted 'Objective Court' dested Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die; 'JP' Tatooine: Jabba's Palace; 'Kashyyk System'/'Tatooine System' Kashyyyk/Tatooine; 'Vader w/stick' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'DVLOTS' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Tarkin' Grand Moff Tarkin; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Lt. Pol Treidom' Lt. Pol Treidum; 'Bubbo' Bubo; 'Tortue' Torture; 'Reator Terminal' Reactor Terminal; 'IG-88 In IG2000' IG-88 In IG-2000.",
    "Secret Plans and Come Here You Big Coward are the Special Edition Effects (April 2000; Defensive Shields came later)."
